    "updated_at": "2024-05-06T15:51:27Z",
    "body": "Well, \"ambient\" was doing a lot of work there. The idea would be for Web IDL to handle these kind of cases correctly so nobody has to think about them again.\r\n\r\nIf you could add a minimal `window.js` test I think inventing the conventions is fine?",
